body:
@rvagg 

> I'd not be opposed to floating a patch on v8 for this when they drop support for 4.4 upstream because we're going to have to be supporting this version for some time and will be adding our own patches to it anyway.

Yup, that was my thinking. Floating patches are a pain but when upstream drops v8 4.4 support this will not be a floating patch. And while backporting patches is always risky, since [the patch](https://codereview.chromium.org/1307943007) is really a [one-liner](https://codereview.chromium.org/1307943007/diff/1/src/ast.cc), the risk should be much smaller and I'm sure many people would be grateful for that.

